# PLAN-965 T-08 — permanent M2-A control flow, error propagation & generator
# corpus: `try`/`catch`/`finally`, `rethrow`/`fail`, `??` short-circuit, `.?`/
# `.?(default)`, `is` pattern expr, nested `break`/`continue`/`return`, and
# `~Iter<T>` lazy generators with early-break `close` cleanup, plus negative
# compile & uncaught-fail controls on `ac-av/aggregates-source-run-v1`.
# Four-end parity (AV / native PE / a2x-rust / a2x-c) is asserted in
# `ace-av` (`aggregates_m2_965`), `ace-native` (`control_effects_965`), and
# `ace-a2x-worker` (`aggregates_965_control_effects_{rust,c}`).

